# Preserve bytes exactly as published.
#
# This tree is a byte-identical copy of files maintained in an internal monorepo,
# and a patch sent here is ported back to the same path there. End-of-line
# rewriting on checkout or commit would break that equivalence and would make the
# publication tool's `diff` report every rewritten file as changed forever, which
# is how real drift stops being visible.
#
# `-text` disables eol conversion without marking anything binary, so GitHub and
# `git diff` still render normal text diffs.
* -text
